## SQ-TXQ-01
@group A
@commands Any small server batch of the run: `qrun.py lint BATCH` then `qrun.py run OUT BATCH RES`
@pass lint prints `lint: ... E, ... W`; the run prints the same E lines first; `RES/verdicts/<ID>.json` per row with `checks` (one per expect / waitlog / shell ...), `looks`, `verdict`; `qrun.py table RES` matches `results.md`
@fails `qverdict.write`, `run_row` `chk()`
