## SQ-TXQ-02 | say then a long sleep; JVM killed during the sleep
@group A
@commands Batch with one row `> say a`, `sleep 60`; during the sleep, from another shell, `kill -9` the scratch server pid (`game_jvms.sh`)
@pass that row ends CRASH within about 5 s ("JVM pid N gone with no crash file"), `RES/crash/<ID>/` holds `logs_latest.log`, the batch ends with "no --relaunch given"; no later row times out
@fails `qwatch.Watch.check`; the qrun shell cannot see the game pids (gotchas): it then says "watching crash files only"
@from batches/r1116/txq02.qb
> say a
sleep 60

