@commands `qrun.py matrix SPEC RES --plan`, then without `--plan`; SPEC: case M01 = Power Grid gate jar on the client only (`cli_jars`), server without it (no PGJAR), `"expect": "refuse"`; case M02 = Power Grid on both (`srv_env` PGJAR, `cli_jars`), `"expect": "join"`
